{"id":"H0290","lemma":"אֲחִימַ֫עַץ","transliteration":"achimaats","sayIt":"a-chi-MA-ats","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Ahimaaz","meaning":"A man living at the time of United Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Sa.14.50;\nfather of: Ahinoam (H0293)\n§ Ahimaaz = \"my brother is anger (wrath)\"\n1) father-in-law of Saul\n2) Zadok's son who aided David during Absalom's rebellion\n3) a supply officer of Solomon","glosses":["ahimaaz","then ahimaaz","so ahimaaz"],"count":15,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1sa-14","v":50,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Ahimaaz","kjv":"of Ahimaaz"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-15","v":27,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ahimaaz","kjv":"Ahimaaz"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-15","v":36,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ahimaaz","kjv":"Ahimaaz"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-17","v":17,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Ahimaaz","kjv":"and Ahimaaz"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-17","v":20,"renderings":{"bsb":"are Ahimaaz","kjv":"Where is Ahimaaz"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-18","v":19,"renderings":{"bsb":"Then Ahimaaz","kjv":"himaaz"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-18","v":22,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ahimaaz","kjv":"Ahimaaz"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-18","v":23,"renderings":{"bsb":"So Ahimaaz","kjv":"Then Ahimaaz"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-18","v":27,"renderings":{"bsb":"like Ahimaaz","kjv":"of Ahimaaz"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-18","v":28,"renderings":{"bsb":"Then Ahimaaz","kjv":"And Ahimaaz"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-18","v":29,"renderings":{"bsb":"And Ahimaaz","kjv":"And Ahimaaz"}},{"chapterId":"1ki-4","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ahimaaz","kjv":"Ahimaaz"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-6","v":8,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ahimaaz","kjv":"Ahimaaz"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-6","v":9,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ahimaaz","kjv":"And Ahimaaz"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-6","v":53,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Ahimaaz","kjv":"Ahimaaz"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Samuel 14:50","note":"The name of Saul’s wife was Ahinoam the daughter of Ahimaaz. The name of the captain of his army was Abner the son of Ner, Saul’s uncle.","source":"web"},{"ref":"2 Samuel 15:27","note":"The king said also to Zadok the priest, “Aren’t you a seer? Return into the city in peace, and your two sons with you, Ahimaaz your son, and Jonathan the son…","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Kings 4:15","note":"Ahimaaz, in Naphtali (he also took Basemath the daughter of Solomon as wife);","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 6:8","note":"Ahitub became the father of Zadok. Zadok became the father of Ahimaaz.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0293","lemma":"אֲחִינֹ֫עַם","transliteration":"achinoam","gloss":"Ahinoam"},{"id":"H6659","lemma":"צָדוֹק","transliteration":"tsadoq","gloss":"Zadok"},{"id":"H5838","lemma":"עֲזַרְיָ֫הוּ","transliteration":"azaryah","gloss":"Azariah"},{"id":"H1315","lemma":"בָּֽשְׂמַת","transliteration":"bosmat","gloss":"Basemath"}],"senses":[{"id":"H0290H","gloss":"Ahimaaz","relation":"H0290H ="},{"id":"H0290I","gloss":"Ahimaaz","relation":"H0290I ="}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}